      "displayText": "Je tiens à essayer tous les\nrestaurants de la ville !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007400690065006E0073002000E00020006500730073006100790065007200200074006F007500730020006C00650073000A00720065007300740061007500720061006E007400730020006400650020006C0061002000760069006C006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quitte à venir à Illumis, autant\ncapturer des Pokémon, non ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750069007400740065002000E0002000760065006E00690072002000E000200049006C006C0075006D00690073002C00200061007500740061006E0074000A00630061007000740075007200650072002000640065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C0020006E006F006E0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je sais pas si t’auras le temps de\nfaire plaisir à tout le monde...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000730061006900730020007000610073002000730069002000742019006100750072006100730020006C0065002000740065006D00700073002000640065000A0066006100690072006500200070006C00610069007300690072002000E000200074006F007500740020006C00650020006D006F006E00640065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
